      "text": "@USCG is advancing counter-UAS capabilities to detect, assess, and mitigate drone threats in the maritime domain. Through funding from the One Big Beautiful Bill Act, we ordered over $150M in C-UAS technology, enhancing our ability to control, secure, and defend ports, waterways, and critical infrastructure. \n\nThese investments will provide our maritime fighting force with critical defensive capability for major upcoming events including 2026 FIFA World Cup, America 250, and Sail 250.\n\n@DHSgov #USCG #UAS #ForceDesign2028",
