      "text": "The @USCG is moving forward to modernize America’s domestic icebreaking fleet.\n\nWe’ve recently began to explore new cutter designs that will replace our aging 140-foot and 65-foot icebreakers.\n\nThese future Homeland Security Cutters will keep America’s waterways open, safe, and secure — facilitating $5.4T annually in maritime commerce, strengthening national security, and enhancing economic prosperity. \n\nLink to RFIs:\n\nHomeland Security Cutter – Medium Icebreakers\nhttps://t.co/30I97gBrZQ\n\nHomeland Security Cutter - Light Icebreakers\nhttps://t.co/MFfKMbWlyi\n\n@DHSgov #USCG #HomelandSecurityCutter #ForceDesign2028",
