      "text": "Mobile, layered security across 31,000 miles of maritime borders.\n\nIn October, @USCG crews across California, Texas, and Puerto Rico conducted multiple alien interdictions with @CBP and @HSI_HQ — disrupting human smuggling and stopping 90+ illegal crossings.\n\nAlways ready, Coast Guard men and women remain vigilant across our borders and maritime borders, where defense of America begins.\n\n@DHSgov #USCG #MaritimeSecurity #ImmigrationEnforcement #WeOwnTheSea #EveryWarEveryShore",
