      "text": "Transforming our workforce. Reshaping our training capacity. \n\nToday, @USCG released a Request for Information in coordination with @DHSgov to identify possible locations for an additional training center. As the Coast Guard modernizes through Force Design 2028 and grows by up to 15,000 personnel, we need additional training capacity to shape a more agile, capable, and responsive maritime fighting force. \n\n🔗Learn more: \n-Force Design 2028: https://t.co/XityiodE2w\n-Training Center RFI: https://t.co/mtLrdqBeHK\n-Press Release: https://t.co/KnwYtr5FMR",
